<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <tab id="magenx" translate="label" sortOrder="400">
            <label>Magenx</label>
        </tab>
        <section id="magenx_bestseller" translate="label" sortOrder="400" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
            <class>separator-top</class>
            <label>Best Sellers</label>
            <tab>magenx</tab>
            <resource>Magenx_BestSellerGraphQl::config</resource>
            <group id="general" translate="label" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>General</label>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Enable Best Sellers</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>When disabled the bestSellers query returns empty and no product badge is resolved.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="count" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Number of Products</label>
                    <validate>validate-digits validate-greater-than-zero</validate>
                    <comment>How many products the store-wide and per-category best-seller lists return. Products the storefront hides (disabled, not visible individually, or not in this website) are excluded from the ranking.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="period" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Report Period</label>
                    <source_model>Magenx\BestSellerGraphQl\Model\Config\Source\Period</source_model>
                    <comment>The aggregated report bucket the ranking is computed over: sales so far today, this month, or this year (in the store's timezone). Early in a bucket the ranking reflects only a partial period — on Daily, shortly after midnight, it may be empty.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
            </group>
            <group id="badge" translate="label" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Product Badge</label>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Enable Per-Category Badge</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Show an Amazon-style "#N Best Seller in &lt;Category&gt;" badge on product pages.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="max_rank" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Maximum Badged Rank</label>
                    <validate>validate-digits validate-greater-than-zero</validate>
                    <comment>A product only earns a badge when its rank in some category is at or above (numerically at or below) this value.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
